{
  "_help": "What sentences mean what for her brain (personality/brain.py). Each intent has a key (the answer pool in voicepacks/default/brain.json) and patterns. Patterns are regular expressions matched against the sentence in lower case, with punctuation and apostrophes removed (whats, im, dont). The FIRST intent that matches wins, so put specific ones first. kind: line (default), sellprice, buyprice, mined, game, status, wanted, time, date, suggest, coin, dice, number, opinion, fact, riddle, riddle_answer, why, more, you, really.",
